---
/* Instruction, not spectacle. Same restraint as the contributors block: plain
   prose, no reveal. */
---

<section class="section" id="join">
  <div class="quiet-head">
    <h2>How to join</h2>
    <p>
      The pilot is invite-only. If you have an invite link from the pilot
      operator, <a href="/install">the install page</a> is the whole path: build
      the client, enrol, see exactly what would be sent, and submit. Once you
      have submitted a few traces you can claim a handle and appear on the
      leaderboard, or stay unlisted and contribute anyway.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quiet-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .quiet-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quiet-head p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .quiet-head a {
    color: var(--ink-color);
  }

  .quiet-head a:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
